    "notes": "Published per-project quotas: 500 instances, 4,000 vCPU, 8,000 GiB memory, shared with bare-metal and GPU instances; volume quotas 1,000 volumes / 100,000 GB and 1,000 snapshots / 100,000 GB; all raisable via Helpdesk. GPU-specific count and new-account verification/SLA not established; project ceiling is not reserved capacity. Only general region is kr-central-2 (Seoul; kr-central-1 discontinued 2025-03-31); kr-gov-central-1/2 for public institutions.",
    "sources": [
      "https://docs.kakaocloud.com/en/service/bcs/vm/vm-pricing"
